    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d209">

                <pb facs="0371" n="257" sameAs="frus:frus1924v01/pg257"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">358.116 M 82/38: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Sweden</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Bliss</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Stockholm</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-06-07T13:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 7, 1924—1
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received June 7—11:50
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>19. With reference to my despatch number 115, January 25,<anchor n="46"
                        xml:id="d209-f1"/> Foreign Office informs me that hereafter visas for
                    Mormons will be subject to the same regulations as applied to all
                    foreigners.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bliss</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
